<title>GERMANY: German August import prices fall 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German August import prices fall 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES     Aug 96     July 96     Aug 95</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.2	  -0.3	 +0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    -0.3	  +0.5	 +0.5</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991)  96.9	  97.1	 97.2</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.2	  -0.2	 +0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    -0.5	  -0.1	 +2.1</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 103.2	 103.4	103.7</p>
<p>-- William Boston, Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
